   * @param {Object} params
   * @param {string} params.phase - 场景阶段 (hook/development/climax)
   * @param {string} params.mood - 情绪基调 (mysterious/epic/tender/tense)
   * @param {string} params.interactionLevel - 互动层次 (observe/probe/approach/resonate)
